  "prefLabel": "Abfd 209.02 Rights of an Intervenor",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Abfd 209.02 Rights of an Intervenor. Notwithstanding the provisions of this chapter, an intervenor’s right to participate in the proceeding shall be subject to any limitations or conditions imposed by the presiding officer pursuant to RSA 541-A:32, III.\n\nSource. #7783, eff 10-26-02",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/abfd100-300.html"
